{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Hi-Fi 是一款專為 iPhone 及 iPad 設計的音樂播放器，提供快速、簡潔的音樂庫存取方式，可播放 Apple Music、iTunes Match、iTunes Store 購買項目或由 Mac／PC 同步的音樂檔案；適合想專注聆聽音樂、不受多餘介面干擾的用家。目前正限時免費，原價 US $3.99。</p>\n\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p>Hi-Fi 以極簡介面減少干擾，可播放 Apple Music、iTunes Match 或同步音樂檔案，並能瀏覽、搜尋及排序音樂庫；支援各種高品質音訊，提供離線模式、播放清單編輯、播放佇列管理，以及藍牙或 AirPlay 串流。程式完全沒有廣告，亦絕不會追蹤用戶。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-433-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-434-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-435-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-436-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-437-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-438-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Hi-Fi</li>\n<li>應用類別：Music</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T11:18:35.571260+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}